      "name": "Push Authorization Data API",
      "description": {
        "content": "PushNotification is a generic data channel to send Commercial Data to the end user over VDP. This API has capability to send Authorization data sets, Enhanced Data , Transaction data and Starter Data sets. Each push notification sent through VDP will have ONLY ONE of above data set i.e. auth or enhanced or transaction or starter data not a combined data sets.",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
